expression: "help(&[\"snapshot\", \"--help\"])"
---
Save or restore an instance snapshot

Usage: tensor-wasm snapshot [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  save     Capture the state of a running instance into a `.tensor-wasm` file via the API
  restore  Restore an instance from a `.tensor-wasm` archive via the API
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --tenant <TENANT>  Tenant id to advertise on outbound API requests via `X-TensorWasm-Tenant`. Zero (the default) suppresses the header for backwards compatibility [default: 0]
  -h, --help             Print help
